2. Dataset (K-News-Stance-MM) -- CC BY-NC 4.0
================================================================================

Applies to the dataset distributed for `data/k_news_stance_mm/` (the Korean
release and its English, Chinese, Indonesian, and Arabic translations), which is
obtained through the download form described in `data/README.md`.

K-News-Stance-MM is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

You may share and adapt the dataset for non-commercial purposes with
appropriate attribution. Commercial use is not permitted.

The dataset contains news article text whose copyright remains with the
respective publishers; it is redistributed for non-commercial research use only.
Original news images are not redistributed -- the dataset provides their source
URLs, and each publisher's terms govern their use.
